<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - K.C. Southern raised.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - K.C. Southern raised.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Merrill Lynch said it raised its near-term rating on Kansas City Southern Industries Inc to buy from accumulate.</p>
<p>-- Kept long-term buy rating.</p>
<p>-- Further details not immediately available.</p>
</text>
